        "Naa paapa bhaaramunu siluvanu moyan",
        "Naa paapa shaapamunu siluvanu veyan",
        "Parishuddhude – Nararoopudai",
        "Arudhenchenu – Bethlehemulo",
        "Shodhana nundi nanu vimochimpan",
        "Vedhana nundi nanu rakshimpan",
        "Paramaathmude – Immaanuyeludai",
        "Arudhenchenu – Bethlehemulo",
        "Mahilo leni mahimanu naaku",
        "Vela ichchi konaleni shaanthini naaku",
        "Sarvonnathude – Prasaadhimpanu",
        "Arudhenchenu – Bethlehemulo"
